OL,3,GNEWSA'Disgraceful' council threatens to
OL,4,Aremove memorials
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been accused of
OL,7,F"disgraceful" behaviour, after it left
OL,8,Fnotices stating some memorials left on
OL,9,Fgraves in a cemetery must be removed.
OL,11,FBristol City Council put up signs
OL,12,Faround South Bristol Cemetery saying
OL,13,Fthose memorials which cover an area
OL,14,Flarger than the allocated gravesite
OL,15,Fwill be removed, and thrown away, if
OL,16,Fthey are not collected by 1 September.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
