OL,3,GNEWSA'Disgraceful' council threatens to
OL,4,Aremove memorials
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Shannon Brimble, 38, whose brother
OL,7,FDuane is buried in the cemetery, called
OL,8,Fthe policy "absolutely disgusting and
OL,9,Fdisgraceful". "We didn't buy half a
OL,10,Fcoffin, my brother's not half a
OL,11,Fperson," she told the BBC.
OL,13,FIn a statement, council leader Tony
OL,14,FDyer said "almost all families" have
OL,15,Fcomplied with the rules, which are
OL,16,Fclearly outlined.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
